<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακληρ-όω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακληρ-κλᾱρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assign by lot, allot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ἑκάστῃ . . φερνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					978
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				30.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶτὰς φυλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					531.29
				</span></i>
			 (Dyme, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>):—
				Med.
			, <i>have allotted to one,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῦφον ἐκ νόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					28.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>,al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				760c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>choose by lot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.3.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέκατον δ. θανεῖν,</span> of
			decimating soldiers, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				2.47
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			 c. acc., ib.<i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>, al.: but usu. abs., <i>cast lots,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.3.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς σφᾶς αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					59.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
